OL,3,GNEWSAA5 road costs hit almost #200m
OL,4,Awithout work starting yet
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost #200m has now been spent on the
OL,7,FA5 road building project despite work
OL,8,Fhaving yet to start on the road, it has
OL,9,Femerged.
OL,11,FThe 58-mile (85km) dual carriageway
OL,12,Fbetween Londonderry and the border at
OL,13,FAughnacloy was first announced in 2007,
OL,14,Fbut has been beset by funding and legal
OL,15,Fissues.
OL,17,FPoliticians on Stormont's
OL,18,Finfrastructure committee have been told
OL,19,Fit has already cost #192.5m even though
OL,20,Fconstruction work yet to begin. Two
OL,21,Fyears ago the figure stood at just over
OL,22,F#100m.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
