OL,3,GNEWSAA5 road costs hit almost #200m
OL,4,Awithout work starting yet
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe department's top civil servant said
OL,7,Fit was not a "disproportionate" use of
OL,8,Fpublic money given the ongoing legal
OL,9,Fcase and planning to date, but DUP MLA
OL,10,FJonathan Buckley described the figure
OL,11,Fas "staggering".
